This directory is cKanren (its own README and notices are preserved
beside this file) with the core exchanged for the recursive miniKanren
one: walk, walk* and occurs-check carry the variables they have
entered, unify is equi-recursive over (==> x t) annotations, and a
self-referential binding is taken and named rather than refused.  See
NOTICE at the repository root for provenance, and vendor/mk-recursive
for the same change applied to Byrd's plain miniKanren.

The original, unmodified library is kept in git history rather than in
the working tree: commit 3c945f9 bundled it as vendor/cKanren, and
  git show 3c945f9:vendor/cKanren/ck.scm
reads any file of it. Nothing in the tree requires it.
